app.use(helmet());          // sets X‑Content‑Type‑Options, X‑Frame‑Options, etc.
```
Optionally configure CSP, Referrer‑Policy, and HSTS (if TLS is used).

### 3.4. Enable Rate Limiting
```js
const rateLimit = require('express-rate-limit');
